{"id": 531, "modified": "2026-10-08T15:31:14", "slug": "paediatric-gastroenterology-hepatology-and-nutrition", "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">This department diagnoses and treats diseases of the digestive tract, liver and pancreas, as well as nutrition-related conditions, in children from infancy to 18 years. Each child is assessed with a holistic approach. MedLuxLife arranges consultations and investigations at our partner hospital and supports families with travel and translation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":941,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-462.jpg\" alt=\"Pediatric Gastroenterology, Hepatology and Nutrition - specialist hospital care\" class=\"wp-image-941\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Treatments and services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Upper digestive tract</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Assessment of disorders of the oesophagus, stomach and duodenum.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Intestinal disorders</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Diagnosis and treatment of diseases of the small and large intestine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Liver, gallbladder and pancreas</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Paediatric hepatology care for liver and gallbladder conditions, and evaluation of pancreatic disorders.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nutrition</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Assessment and management of nutritional problems and nutrition-related diseases in children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conditions treated</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Oesophageal diseases</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Stomach diseases</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Duodenal diseases</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Diseases of the small and large intestine</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Liver diseases</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Gallbladder diseases</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nutritional disorders</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Previous endoscopy or ultrasound reports</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent blood and stool test results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your Paediatric Gastroenterology, Hepatology and Nutrition consultation with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"}}